### 1. Create a New Post (For Testing)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Advanced JPA",
  "description": "Learn how to use JPA Specifications and Custom Queries effectively.",
  "content": "In this tutorial, we will dive deep into Java Persistence API. We will cover CriteriaBuilder and JPQL. It is essential for backend developers.",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/id/10/200/300",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "category": {
    "name": "Programming"
  },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "Java" },
    { "name": "Database" }
  ]
}

> {%
    client.global.set("postId", response.body.id);
    client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.category.id);
    // Capture the ID of the 'Java' tag (assuming it's the first one)
    client.global.set("tagId", response.body.tags[0].id);
%}

###

### 2. Get Post Feed (No Filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 3. Search Mixed (Default)
# Should find the post because "Tutorial" is in the title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Tutorial
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 4. Search by TITLE Only
# Should find the post because "Advanced" is in the title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Advanced&searchType=TITLE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 5. Search by TITLE Only (Negative Test)
# Should NOT find the post, because "CriteriaBuilder" is only in the content, not the title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=CriteriaBuilder&searchType=TITLE
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 6. Search by CONTENT Only
# Should find the post because "CriteriaBuilder" is in the content
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=CriteriaBuilder&searchType=CONTENT
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 7. Filter by Category Only
# Should return posts in "Programming"
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?categoryId={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 8. Complex Filter: Content Search + Category
# Search for "Java" in CONTENT, strictly within "Programming" category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Java&searchType=CONTENT&categoryId={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 9. Complex Filter: Tag + Title Search
# Search for "Spring" in TITLE, strictly matching the "Java" tag
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts?query=Spring&searchType=TITLE&tagId={{tagId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

###

### 10. Update Post
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "Spring Boot Tutorial: Advanced JPA (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "content": "Content updated.",
  "imageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/id/11/200/300",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "category": { "name": "Programming" },
  "tags": [ { "name": "Java" } ]
}

###

### 11. Delete Post
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 12. Create a Post Draft
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/draft
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "My Rough Ideas",
  "description": "Just a quick thought...",
  "content": "This is a work in progress. I will finish it later.",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "category": {
    "name": "Journal"
  },
  "tags": []
}

> {%
    client.global.set("draftId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 13. Get Drafts (Paged)
# Should return a PagedResponse of drafts for the current user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/posts/drafts?page=0&size=5
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}